     A*                 ADD DATE FOR ADOPTION OF 3 DIGIT RATES.       *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 08/22/95  C:28  PROJECT: WC446                                *
     A*                 ADDED AS A BASE FILE.                         *
     A*                                                               *
     A* 09/26/96  C:61  PROJECT: WC525                                *
     A*                 ADD A NEW FIELD FOR PREMIUM RATING STATE CODE *
     A*                                                               *
     A*****************************************************************
     A                                      REF(WREFP)
     A          R PRS01                     TEXT('RATE SET CODE MASTER FILE')
     A            RSCO#     R               REFFLD(CO#)
     A            RSRTCD    R               REFFLD(BSCO)
     A                                      COLHDG('RATE SET' 'CODE')
     A            RSDESC    R               REFFLD(DS30)
     A            RSCRFL    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A                                      COLHDG('CONSENT' 'TO RATE')
     A            RSSTAT    R               REFFLD(STAT)
     A            RSUSER    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A            RSPGM     R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A            RSTIME    R               REFFLD(TIME)
     A            RSDT      R               REFFLD(DT)
     A            RSIPGM    R               REFFLD(PGM)
     A                                      COLHDG('INITIAL PROGRAM')
     A            RSIUSR    R               REFFLD(USER)
     A                                      COLHDG('RECORD CREATED BY')
     A            RSIDT     R               REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('DATE RECORD CREATED')
     A            RSJRST    R               REFFLD(ST)
     A                                      COLHDG('PREMIUM RATING STATE')
     A*** BEGIN ADD ***  06/25/25  ******************************************
     A            RS3DATE   R     S         REFFLD(DT)
     A                                      COLHDG('ADOPTION DATE OF 3 ' +
     A                                             'DIGIT RATES')
     A*** END ADD *****  06/25/25  ******************************************
